#: ../developer/runtime-settings.md:1
msgid "Host runtime settings"
msgstr "主机运行时设置"

#: ../developer/runtime-settings.md:3
msgid ""
"Admin Settings defines defaults for every host; an individual server's "
"settings can override them. The effective values arrive on its next "
"heartbeat. The runner hands each turn a validated snapshot, and pushes "
"sandbox manager settings to its separate sandbox manager. Clearing an "
"admin override restores the built-in default. Environment variables "
"supply bootstrap values only until the first settings answer arrives."
msgstr ""
"Admin Settings 里设的是所有主机的默认值，单台服务器可以用自己的设置覆盖。最终生效的值会随这台服务器的下一次心跳下发。runner "
"每跑一个轮次，都会交给它一份校验过的设置快照，并把 sandbox manager 相关的设置推送给独立运行的 sandbox "
"manager。清除管理员的覆盖值，就会回到内置默认值。环境变量只在第一次拿到设置之前充当初始值。"

#: ../developer/runtime-settings.md:10
msgid ""
"The complete registry, labels, units, scopes, and validation ranges live "
"in "
"[`cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py)."
" The admin UI reads that registry rather than maintaining another list."
msgstr ""
"所有设置项的完整清单，包括标签、单位、作用范围和取值范围，都在 "
"[`cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py)"
" 里。管理界面直接读这份清单，不另外维护一份。"

#: ../developer/runtime-settings.md:14
msgid ""
"**Storage reserve for new sandboxes** (`storage_min_available_mib`) is a "
"runner setting with a default of 1024 MiB and a range of 1–1,048,576 MiB."
" Its bootstrap variable is `AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`. Before "
"accepting a turn that would allocate a sandbox, the runner reads fresh "
"available space through the existing attested Docker writable-layer "
"storage probe. A reading below the reserve declines the untouched turn; "
"the server's launch error describes the pressure and suggests freeing "
"storage or adjusting this setting. Existing retained sandboxes can resume"
" and cleanup stays available."
msgstr ""
"**Storage reserve for new sandboxes**（`storage_min_available_mib`）是一项 "
"runner 设置，默认 1024 MiB，可设范围 1–1,048,576 MiB，对应的初始化环境变量是 "
"`AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`。runner 接下一个需要新建沙箱的轮次之前，会先用现有的、经过证明的 "
"Docker 可写层存储探针读一次当前的可用空间。如果低于这个预留值，runner "
"就不接这个轮次，轮次保持原样；服务器的启动错误会说明存储吃紧，并建议腾出空间或调整这项设置。已有的保留沙箱照样可以恢复，清理也照常可用。"

#: ../developer/runtime-settings.md:23
msgid ""
"This guard is not a quota or space reservation. Unknown, disabled, "
"unavailable, unsupported, or unverified capacity remains explicitly "
"unmeasured and does not establish a storage-pressure verdict. See "
"[storage measurement and attestation](operations.md#how-full-is-the-"
"sandbox-storage) and [host execution limits](host-execution-limits.md) "
"for operational boundaries."
msgstr ""
"这道保护既不是配额，也不会真的预留空间。容量如果是未知、已禁用、读不到、不支持或未经验证，就明确记为\"未测量\"，不会据此判定存储吃紧。运维上的边界见[存储测量与证明](operations.md"
"#how-full-is-the-sandbox-storage)和[主机执行限制](host-execution-limits.md)。"

